{"path":"numeric/complex/cabs","title":"cabsf, cabs, cabsl","titleHtml":"cabsf, cabs, cabsl","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/numeric/complex/cabs","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"If no errors occur, returns the absolute value (norm, magnitude) of z.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex\"><code>&lt;complex.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">float</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; cabsf<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">float</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/complex\"><span class=\"kw743\">complex</span></a> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;cabs<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/complex\"><span class=\"kw743\">complex</span></a> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> cabsl<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/complex\"><span class=\"kw743\">complex</span></a> z <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/tgmath\"><code>&lt;tgmath.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define fabs( z )</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1-3)</span> Computes the complex absolute value (also known as norm, modulus, or magnitude) of <code>z</code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Type-generic macro: if <code>z</code> has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/complex\"><span class=\"kw743\">complex</span></a></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/imaginary\"><span class=\"kw745\">imaginary</span></a></span></code>, <code>cabsl</code> is called. If <code>z</code>  has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">float</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/complex\"><span class=\"kw743\">complex</span></a></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">float</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/imaginary\"><span class=\"kw745\">imaginary</span></a></span></code>, <code>cabsf</code> is called. If <code>z</code> has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/complex\"><span class=\"kw743\">complex</span></a></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/imaginary\"><span class=\"kw745\">imaginary</span></a></span></code>, <code>cabs</code> is called. For real and integer types, the corresponding version of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/fabs\">fabs</a></span> is called.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  z\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  complex argument\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If no errors occur, returns the absolute value (norm, magnitude) of <code>z</code>.\n</p><p>Errors and special cases are handled as if the function is implemented as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/hypot\"><span class=\"kw667\">hypot</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/creal\"><span class=\"kw754\">creal</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/cimag\"><span class=\"kw751\">cimag</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;complex.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/complex\"><span class=\"kw743\">complex</span></a> z <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>I<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw848\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"%.1f%+.1fi cartesian is rho=%f theta=%f polar<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>,\n           <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/creal\"><span class=\"kw754\">creal</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/cimag\"><span class=\"kw751\">cimag</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, cabs<span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/carg\"><span class=\"kw757\">carg</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>z<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1.0+1.0i cartesian is rho=1.414214 theta=0.785398 polar</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.3.8.1 The cabs functions (p: 195)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 373-375)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> G.7 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 545)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.3.8.1 The cabs functions (p: 177)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 335-337)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> G.7 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 480)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex/carg\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>carg</span><span>cargf</span><span>cargl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes the phase angle of a complex number  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/abs\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abs</span><span>labs</span><span>llabs</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes absolute value of an integral value (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small{|x|}\">|x|</span>)  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/fabs\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fabs</span><span>fabsf</span><span>fabsl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes absolute value of a floating-point value (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small{|x|}\">|x|</span>) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/hypot\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>hypot</span><span>hypotf</span><span>hypotl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes square root of the sum of the squares of two given numbers (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2} }\"><span class=\"t-mrad\"><span>√</span><span>x<span class=\"t-su\">2<br></span>+y<span class=\"t-su\">2<br></span></span></span></span>)  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/complex/abs\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>abs</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table></div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics"},{"path":"numeric/complex","title":"Complex number arithmetic"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"cabsf, cabs, cabsl","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations. Computes the complex absolute value (also known as norm, modulus, or magnitude) of z."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"z"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If no errors occur, returns the absolute value (norm, magnitude) of z."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"carg, cargf, cargl","note":"computes the phase angle of a complex number"},{"label":"abs, labs, llabs","note":"computes absolute value of an integral value (|x|)"},{"label":"fabs, fabsf, fabsl","note":"computes absolute value of a floating-point value (|x|)"},{"label":"hypot, hypotf, hypotl","note":"computes square root of the sum of the squares of two given numbers (√x2+y2)"}]}]},"standards":["C99"],"wordCount":276,"codeBlockCount":2}
